* Encoding: UTF-8.
* Uji performa Statify vs SPSS: mv1-n10000, 11 run GLM (run 1 = pemanasan).
* Dibuat oleh testing/performance-spss/spss/make_jobs.py.
SET DECIMAL=DOT.
OMS /SELECT TABLES /IF COMMANDS=['GLM'] SUBTYPES=['Notes']
  /DESTINATION FORMAT=OXML OUTFILE='D:\0.POLTSTAT STIS\Tugas Kuliah\Skripsi\topik baru statify\statify64\testing\performance-spss\spss\rm-teks\oms\mv1-n10000-notes.xml'
  /TAG='notes'.
OMS /SELECT TABLES /IF COMMANDS=['GLM']
  /DESTINATION FORMAT=OXML OUTFILE='D:\0.POLTSTAT STIS\Tugas Kuliah\Skripsi\topik baru statify\statify64\testing\performance-spss\spss\rm-teks\oms\mv1-n10000-full.xml'
  /TAG='full'.
GET DATA /TYPE=TXT /FILE='D:\0.POLTSTAT STIS\Tugas Kuliah\Skripsi\topik baru statify\statify64\testing\performance-spss\data\mv1-n10000.csv' /ENCODING='UTF8'
  /DELCASE=LINE /DELIMITERS="," /ARRANGEMENT=DELIMITED /FIRSTCASE=2
  /VARIABLES=Y1 F12.6 Y2 F12.6 Y3 F12.6 Y4 F12.6 A A2.
CACHE.
EXECUTE.
* Run 1 (pemanasan).
GLM Y1 Y2 Y3 Y4 BY A
  /METHOD=SSTYPE(3)
  /INTERCEPT=INCLUDE
  /PRINT=DESCRIPTIVE ETASQ OPOWER HOMOGENEITY
  /CRITERIA=ALPHA(.05)
  /DESIGN=A.
OMSEND TAG=['full'].
